  "project_id": 7898047,
  "title": "VXLAN: Fix dissection of VXLAN - Reordering flag arrays. Moving...",
  "description": "[vxlan.pcap](/uploads/77ded55c51bcc4b29b491cd40b1ae1f6/vxlan.pcap)\n\nVXLAN: Fixing dissector of VXLAN - Reordering flag arrays. Moving &hf_vxlan_flag_d and &hf_vxlan_flag_i according to sequence of bits to correctly show the data in the captures.\n\n1. Array will change from:  \n\n```\nstatic int * const flags_fields[] = {\n        &hf_vxlan_flag_g,\n        &hf_vxlan_flag_d,<<<\n        &hf_vxlan_flag_i,<<<\n        &hf_vxlan_flag_a,\n        &hf_vxlan_flags_reserved,\n        NULL\n    };\n```\n\n2. To:\n\n```\nstatic int * const flags_fields[] = {\n        &hf_vxlan_flag_g,\n        &hf_vxlan_flag_i,<<<\n        &hf_vxlan_flag_d,<<<\n        &hf_vxlan_flag_a,\n        &hf_vxlan_flags_reserved,\n        NULL\n    };\n```\n\nThis will allow the user to see the information according to:\n\nBefore:\n\n```\nFlags: 0x0800, VXLAN Network ID (VNI)\n0... .... .... .... = GBP Extension: Not defined\n.... .... .0.. .... = Don't Learn: False <<<<<<<< Incorrect order\n.... 1... .... .... = VXLAN Network ID (VNI): True <<<<<<<< Incorrect order\n.... .... .... 0... = Policy Applied: False\n.000 .000 0.00 .000 = Reserved(R): 0x0000\n```\n\nAfter:\n\n```\nFlags: 0x0800, VXLAN Network ID (VNI)\n0... .... .... .... = GBP Extension: Not defined\n.... 1... .... .... = VXLAN Network ID (VNI): True <<<<<<<< Correct order\n.... .... .0.. .... = Don't Learn: False <<<<<<<< Correct order\n.... .... .... 0... = Policy Applied: False\n.000 .000 0.00 .000 = Reserved(R): 0x0000\n```\n\nAttached is the file 'vxlan.pcap' to visualize the bug.",
